    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "The Forge: London technical production studio (advertising). Services: shoot production, stills + motion post production, motion control, virtual production, studio hire. Founded 2009 by Jean-Michel (ex-freelance retoucher); stills team from 2009, motion team added 2015 (6 post artists/producers). Clients incl. Apple, LVMH, Nike, Louis Vuitton, Estee Lauder, Creed, Tom Ford, Byredo, Tanqueray. Hands-on craft studio (post/retouch/motion control), hence Studio over Agency. Work captured from theforge.co project pages: Gordon and Macphail, Dewars 12 Year, Creed Oud, Fraser Chatham/Tom Ford, Tanqueray x Whale Amsterdam, Byredo Hands, Fitasy 2025. Note: all Vimeo films on their project pages are private/embedded-only (progressive redirect URLs; no public Vimeo page accessible); Notion embeds not possible for private Vimeo IDs, project stills captured instead. IG context shot queued (headless blocked). Sources: theforge.co + LinkedIn.",
